The '''Glaymore Stead''' is an abandoned farmland located on the hills overlooking [[Stillward Church]] in [[Gilneas]]. The Glaymore family was once a prominent family of farmers, but during the [[Gilnean civil war]] the entire family was tried for conspiracy and treason to the kingdom, found guilty to the last by [[Judge Sutherland]]. Now, all that remains of them is the [[Angered Phantom]] of Karl Glaymore, who continues to haunt his old home.

